    "table_title": "Schedule of Activities (SoA)",
    "table_purpose": "ISA NP01 (LY3016859, diabetic peripheral neuropathic pain) schedule: visits and procedures unique to the ISA, on top of the master CPMP and DPNP DSA CPMP(3) SoAs; V3-V7 shared with the master, V801-V803 follow-up added",
    "page_start": 10,
    "page_end": 13,
    "notes": "One label column (L=1); data columns at positions 2-10 (V3 -> 2 ... V7 -> 6, V801 -> 7, V802 -> 8, V803 -> 9, ED -> 10); the right-hand Notes column is not a schedule column. Typed main_soa: every participant randomised into this ISA passes through it in sequence. It is a delta schedule: the intro text says it shows only what is unique to the ISA, so the participant's full schedule is this table plus the master and DSA SoAs. The taxonomy has no type for that relation; it is recorded here and in g1."
